170
00:06:03,128 --> 00:06:05,482
the average doc fee in America is

171
00:06:05,482 --> 00:06:07,836
four hundred seventy-two dollars.

172
00:06:08,187 --> 00:06:09,998
But the range is enormous.

173
00:06:10,178 --> 00:06:11,652
According to CarEdge,

174
00:06:11,652 --> 00:06:13,897
