182
00:06:31,693 --> 00:06:33,121
Here is the twist.

183
00:06:33,301 --> 00:06:36,261
Paperwork costs about the same everywhere.

184
00:06:36,441 --> 00:06:37,927
The difference is the law.

185
00:06:38,107 --> 00:06:39,587
According to CarEdge,

186
00:06:39,587 --> 00:06:42,475
nineteen states enforce caps on doc fees,

187
00:06:42,475 --> 00:06:45,574
