189
00:06:47,899 --> 00:06:50,646
and Ohio at three hundred ninety-eight.

190
00:06:50,826 --> 00:06:52,527
In states without caps,

191
00:06:52,527 --> 00:06:55,412
the fee is whatever the dealer decides.

192
00:06:55,592 --> 00:06:57,554
Many dealers say the fee is not

193
00:06:57,554 --> 00:06:58,251
negotiable.

194
00:06:58,431 --> 00:06:59,813
But the truck price is,

195
00:06:59,813 --> 00:07:01,556
so you can ask for a discount

196
00:07:01,556 --> 00:07:02,517
that offsets it.

197
00:07:02,868 --> 00:07:05,267
And here is a detail many buyers

198
00:07:05,267 --> 00:07:05,642
miss.

199
00:07:05,822 --> 00:07:08,019
The doc fee is often printed on

200
00:07:08,019 --> 00:07:10,074
