201
00:07:10,074 --> 00:07:13,404
government fee, next to taxes and registration.

202
00:07:13,584 --> 00:07:14,269
It is not.

203
00:07:14,449 --> 00:07:17,432
Taxes and registration go to the state.

204
00:07:17,612 --> 00:07:19,319
The doc fee goes to the dealer.

205
00:07:19,499 --> 00:07:21,511
Ask the dealer to show you which

206
00:07:21,511 --> 00:07:23,900
fees are government fees and which are

207
00:07:23,900 --> 00:07:24,654
dealer fees.

208
00:07:25,004 --> 00:07:26,315
Trick number four:

209
00:07:26,315 --> 00:07:27,918
the market adjustment.

210
00:07:28,098 --> 00:07:29,561
When a truck is new,

211
00:07:29,561 --> 00:07:30,731
rare or popular,

212
00:07:30,731 --> 00:07:33,292
some dealers add a charge above the

213
00:07:33,292 --> 00:07:36,730
