214
00:07:36,730 --> 00:07:38,779
or additional dealer markup.

215
00:07:38,959 --> 00:07:40,302
It is pure profit,

216
00:07:40,302 --> 00:07:42,467
and it shows up most often on

217
00:07:42,467 --> 00:07:45,751
hot performance trucks and limited editions.

218
00:07:46,101 --> 00:07:47,563
Here is a current example.

219
00:07:47,743 --> 00:07:49,761
In January twenty twenty-six,

220
00:07:49,761 --> 00:07:52,058
Ram announced the return of the T

221
00:07:52,058 --> 00:07:54,632
R X for the twenty twenty-seven model

222
00:07:54,632 --> 00:07:58,111
year, with seven hundred seventy-seven horsepower.

223
00:07:58,291 --> 00:08:00,589
According to Pickup Truck Talk,

224
00:08:00,589 --> 00:08:02,888
its price lands just shy of one

225
00:08:02,888 --> 00:08:06,743
hundred thousand dollars before destination fees and

226
00:08:06,743 --> 00:08:08,670
the likely dealer markups.

227
00:08:08,850 --> 00:08:11,115
When a truck review warns you about

228
00:08:11,115 --> 00:08:13,379
markups in the same sentence as the

229
00:08:13,379 --> 00:08:15,191
price, you know it is a real

230
00:08:15,191 --> 00:08:15,515
risk.

231
00:08:15,865 --> 00:08:18,639
The twist is that markups usually fade.

232
00:08:18,819 --> 00:08:21,381
When a hot truck first launches,

233
00:08:21,381 --> 00:08:22,662
supply is short.

234
00:08:22,842 --> 00:08:24,287
A few months later,

235
00:08:24,287 --> 00:08:25,732
more trucks arrive,

236
00:08:25,732 --> 00:08:27,558
early buyers are served,

237
00:08:27,558 --> 00:08:30,296
and the markups shrink or disappear.

238
00:08:30,476 --> 00:08:31,597
How to beat it:

239
00:08:31,597 --> 00:08:34,289
be patient, contact several dealers,

240
00:08:34,289 --> 00:08:37,055
and order from the factory at sticker

241
00:08:37,055 --> 00:08:39,149
price if a dealer allows it.

242
00:08:39,329 --> 00:08:42,342
The buyer who waits often pays thousands

243
00:08:42,342 --> 00:08:42,719
less.

244
00:08:43,069 --> 00:08:45,823
There is also a softer version of

245
00:08:45,823 --> 00:08:48,328
the markup: limited inventory.

246
00:08:48,508 --> 00:08:50,636
A dealer may only have the high

247
00:08:50,636 --> 00:08:52,833
